{'symbol': 'MDLZ', 'date': '2023-04-05 09:29:00', 'title': 'SOUR PATCH KIDS® DRUMS UP THE FUTURE FOR HBCU STUDENTS WITH MISCHIEF FOR CHANGE SCHOLARSHIP PROGRAM', 'text': 'THE THIRD ANNUAL PROGRAM IS IN PARTNERSHIP WITH THURGOOD MARSHALL COLLEGE FUND AND HBCU MARCHING BANDS EAST HANOVER, N.J. , APRIL 5, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SOUR PATCH KIDS IS CALLING CURRENT OR PROSPECTIVE STUDENTS AT HISTORICALLY BLACK COLLEGES AND UNIVERSITIES (HBCUS) SEEKING SCHOLARSHIP FUNDS TO PARTICIPATE IN THE THIRD ANNUAL "MISCHIEF FOR CHANGE" SCHOLARSHIP PROGRAM.'}